Step 3: Build the Safe Link Unroller Module
​Create a robust helper inside netzilla/core/url_shortener.py that handles SMS/smishing links safely:
​Headless Redirect Tracking: Use Python's requests with strict limits (allow_redirects=True, timeout limits) to follow HTTP Location headers without executing active web browser scripts.
​Cloudflare Hand-off: If a shortener points to an obscure or high-risk domain, pass that final destination URL straight into your Cloudflare Scanner API function rather than opening it locally.
